        "Title": "Hitman8.Episode8.ThirdTime theTruth says",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102898240420",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 64c391f7-4765-48b6-96bc-df8aa5a4186b).Image",
        "Description": "You won&apos;t believe who sent me another message. Sebastian Sato, the old ICA agent, who we have killed already twice, has now contacted us again. He sent me a link to an ad for his own fashion show party in Paris. The ad said in small print &quot;Third time the truth says&quot;, so maybe it&apos;s best if you go there and do some research. If we could get the truth about all this. I would recommend you take some kind of poisonous stinger, like a needle or a paralytic. Good luck.",
